OL,3,ATenko and Coronation Street actress
OL,4,AStephanie Cole dies aged 84
OL,5,
OL,6,FActress Stephanie Cole, known for roles
OL,7,Fin Tenko, Open All Hours and Coronation
OL,8,FStreet, has died aged 84.
OL,10,FA statement from her agent John Grant,
OL,11,Fissued on behalf of her family,
OL,12,Fconfirmed the actress had been living
OL,13,Fwith Alzheimer's for several years.
OL,15,F"Stephanie was an extraordinary talent
OL,16,Fwhose long and distinguished career
OL,17,Fincluded many iconic performances in
OL,18,Ftheatre and television," the statement
OL,19,Fread.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
